  "text": "Venus lost its water, and it left a clue. In 1978, a probe fell through its clouds and tasted the air. Some hydrogen is heavier. On Venus, the heavy share is 100 times Earth's. Sunlight split the water, and the light hydrogen escaped to space. The full film, What Happened to Venus?",
